{"name":"Pink Cocoa Cupcake","hex":"#d1a5a6","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"pink","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A color reminiscent of pinks, the flowers.","Magenta, the colour evoked by red and blue light when combined."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a colour between red and white; pale red.","Of a fox-hunter's jacket: scarlet."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pink"},{"term":"cocoa","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The dried and partially fermented fatty seeds of the cacao tree from which chocolate is made.","An unsweetened brown powder made from roasted, ground cocoa beans, used in making chocolate, and in cooking."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a light to medium brown colour, like that of cocoa powder."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cocoa"},{"term":"cupcake","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A small cake baked in a usually paper container shaped like a cup, often with icing on top.","An attractive young woman."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To flirt; to talk or act amorously or intimately.","To flirt with; to talk or act amorously or intimately to."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cupcake"}],"entries":[{"title":"Cupcake","blocks":[{"text":"A cupcake, fairy cake (BrE), patty cake (AuE), or bun (IrE) is a small cake designed to serve one person, which may be baked in a small thin paper or aluminum cup. As with larger cakes, frosting, icing and various other cake decorations such as fruit and candy may be applied."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Cupcakes%2C_chocolate_and_strawberry_flavour.jpg/330px-Cupcakes%2C_chocolate_and_strawberry_flavour.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cupcake","wikidata":"Q816851"},{"title":"Pink","blocks":[{"text":"Pink is a pale tint of red or rose, the color of the pink flower.